<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Romafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paulo Nwoma A Ɔtwerɛ Kɔmaa Romafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romafoɔ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Paulo Nwoma A</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔtwerɛ Kɔmaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Romafoɔ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Nnwoma yi firi me, Paulo, Yesu Kristo ɔsomfoɔ a wɔayi me sɛ ɔsɛnkafoɔ a wɔasoma me sɛ menkɔka Onyankopɔn asɛmpa no nkyɛn. <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Wɔnam Onyankopɔn adiyifoɔ so dii kan hyɛɛ asɛmpa no ho nkɔm wɔ Apam Dada no mu. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Saa bɔhyɛ yi fa ne Ba Yesu Kristo a ɔyɛ yɛn Awurade a ɔba ma wɔwoo no sɛ akɔkoaa too Ɔhene Dawid abusua mu no ho. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Na Honhom Kronkron da no adi pefee sɛ Yesu Kristo yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnyanee no firii awufoɔ mu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Ɛnam Kristo so enti na Onyankopɔn maa meyɛɛ ɔsomafoɔ maa Kristo, sɛdeɛ nnipa nyinaa nam gyidie so bɛyɛ ɔsetie ama Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Mo a mowɔ Roma a Onyankopɔn afrɛ mo sɛ mommɛyɛ Kristo akyidifoɔ no nso, moka ho bi.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Ɛno enti, meretwerɛ mo a mowɔ Roma nyinaa a Onyankopɔn dɔ mo na wafrɛ mo sɛ mommɛyɛ nʼakyidifoɔ no:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 1:7"/>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Adom ne asomdwoeɛ a ɛfiri yɛn agya Onyankopɔn ne Awurade Yesu Kristo nka mo.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s1">Aseda Mpaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Ansa na mɛka biribiara no, menam Yesu Kristo so da me Onyankopɔn ase ma mo nyinaa, ɛfiri sɛ mo gyidie a mowɔ no aduru ewiase afanan nyinaa. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Onyankopɔn a mede mʼakoma nyinaa som no, na menam asɛmpa a menam ne Ba so ka no nim sɛ, deɛ meka no yɛ nokorɛ. Onyankopɔn nim sɛ mekae mo daa. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Ɛberɛ biara a mebɔ mpaeɛ no, mesrɛ Awurade sɛ ɔmmoa mma mentumi mmɛsra mo seesei ara.<verse eid="ROM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, mepere mehwehwɛ sɛ, mɛhunu mo na maboa mo ama moanya Onyankopɔn honhom mu nhyira na ahyɛ mo den. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Deɛ mekyerɛ ne sɛ, me ne mo nyinaa bɛnya honhom mu ahoɔden ɛberɛ korɔ mu a yɛde bɛhyɛ yɛn ho yɛn ho gyidie mu den. <verse eid="ROM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Me nuanom, monkae sɛ ɛberɛ biara a mɛyɛ mʼadwene sɛ merebɛsra mo no, na biribi abɛbɔ mu. Mepɛ sɛ mesakra nnipa adwene wɔ mo mu sɛdeɛ mayɛ wɔ amanamanmufoɔ mu no.<verse eid="ROM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Mo ne obiara, wɔn a wɔn ani ate ne wɔn a wɔn ani nteeɛ, wɔn a wɔasua adeɛ ne wɔn a wɔnsuaa adeɛ nyinaa ho asɛm yɛ mʼasodie. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Ɛno enti, mede mʼahoɔden a mewɔ nyinaa aboa me ho sɛ mɛba mo nkyɛn wɔ Roma abɛka Onyankopɔn asɛmpa no akyerɛ mo.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Mʼani nwu Asɛmpa no ho, ɛfiri sɛ ɛyɛ Onyankopɔn tumi a ɔnam so gye wɔn a wɔwɔ gyidie nyinaa nkwa; Yudafoɔ kane ɛnna amanamanmufoɔ no nso. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Asɛmpa no kyerɛ yɛn sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn ma yɛyɛ ateneneefoɔ, na ɛnam gyidie so na wama yɛayɛ saa. Sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka no, ɔteneneeni firi gyidie mu bɛnya nkwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Onyankopɔn da nʼabufuo adi firi ɔsoro de tia nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔde nokorɛ no hinta afoforɔ no. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn ada ne nokwasɛm no adi wɔ wɔn mu, na ɔde ne ho nimdeɛ ahyɛ wɔn akoma mu. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Ɛfiri ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn bɔɔ ewiase no, ne tumi a ɛwɔ hɔ daa no ne ne nyamesu no ada adi. Nnipa nam Onyankopɔn abɔdeɛ so tumi hunu saa nneɛma yi, enti wɔnni anoyie biara.<verse eid="ROM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Wɔnim Onyankopɔn, nanso wɔmfa ne anidie a ɛfata no no mma no na wɔnna no ase nso. Ayɛ saa ma wɔn adwene mu nnɔ na esum aduru mu. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Wɔka sɛ wɔyɛ anyansafoɔ nanso wɔyɛ nkwaseafoɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsom Onyankopɔn onimuonyamfoɔ a ɔte hɔ daa no, wɔfaa nnua ne aboɔ yɛɛ ahoni te sɛ nnomaa, mmoadoma, awɔ ne nnipa somm wɔn.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Ɛno enti, Onyankopɔn gyaa wɔn maa afideɛ a ɛfiri wɔn akoma mu, ɛno enti, wɔne wɔn ho wɔn ho yɛɛ aniwudeɛ nso. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Wɔde Onyankopɔn ho nokwasɛm no sesaa atorɔsɛm na wɔsomm abɔdeɛ sene Ɔbɔadeɛ a daa wɔkamfo no no. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Esiane saa enti, Onyankopɔn gyaa wɔn maa honam mu akɔnnɔ a ɛyɛ aniwudeɛ. Na mpo wɔn mmaa fa wɔn yɔnkonom mmaa. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Saa ara nso na na mmarima ne mmaa nna, na mmom, bɔne akɔnnɔ hyɛɛ wɔn maa wɔne wɔn ho wɔn ho daeɛ nam so nyaa akatua a ɛsɛ wɔn.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Esiane sɛ nnipa poo Onyankopɔn ho nokorɛ no enti, wɔfaa wɔn adwemmɔne so yɛɛ nneɛma a ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ mmom. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Amumuyɛ ahodoɔ nyinaa, bɔne, anibereɛ ne nnebɔne hyɛɛ wɔn ma. Nitan, awudie, akasakasa, nsisie ne ɔbra bɔne nso ka ho. Wɔdii nsekuro, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>kaa nsɛm a ɛmfata faa afoforɔ ho; wɔkyirii Onyankopɔn; wɔyɛɛ atutupɛ, ahantan ne ahomasoɔ. Na daa wɔdwene sɛ wɔbɛyɛ bɔne. Wɔantie wɔn awofoɔ asɛm. <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>Na wɔnni suban; na wɔnni wɔn bɔhyɛ so; na wɔnni ayamyɛ ne ahummɔborɔ ma afoforɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Na wɔnim sɛ Onyankopɔn mmara kyerɛ sɛ nnipa a wɔtena ase saa kwan so no sɛ owuo. Nanso wɔnko ara anyɛ saa afideɛ no, na mmom, wɔpenee afoforɔ a wɔyɛɛ saa bɔne korɔ no ara bi no so.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Mo a mobu afoforɔ atɛn no, monni anoyie biara. Ɛkwan biara a mobɛfa so abu afoforɔ atɛn no, ɛnam saa ɛkwan no ara so ma mode atemmuo ba mo ho so. Ɛfiri sɛ, bɔne a ɛma mobu afoforɔ atɛn no, mo nso moyɛ saa bɔne korɔ no ara bi. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Yɛnim sɛ, sɛ Onyankopɔn bu wɔn a wɔte saa ara no atɛn a, na ne kwan so ara ne no. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Na wo, onipa, wobu afoforɔ atɛn wɔ nneɛma korɔ no ara a woyɛ bi no ho a, wosusu sɛ Onyankopɔn remmu wo atɛn anaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Anaasɛ, ebia, wommu nʼayamyɛ, nʼabodwokyerɛ ne ne boasetɔ? Wonnim sɛ Onyankopɔn yɛ mmɔborɔhunufoɔ a ɔpɛ sɛ ɔkyerɛ wo kwan a wobɛfa so anu wo ho?<verse eid="ROM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Nanso, ɛsiane wʼakoma den ne akoma pirim enti, woboaboa abufuhyeɛ ano ma wo ho wɔ Onyankopɔn abufuhyeɛ da no, ɛda no a ɔbɛda nʼatɛntenenee adi no. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Deɛ obiara ayɛ no, ɛso akatua na Onyankopɔn bɛma no anya. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Wɔn a wɔde boasetɔ yɛ papa de hwehwɛ animuonyam, anidie ne deɛ ɛmporɔ no, ɔbɛma wɔn nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Nanso wɔn a wɔyɛ pɛsɛmenkomenya, ne wɔn a wɔpo nokorɛ no kɔdi bɔne akyi no, abufuhyeɛ ne amanehunu bɛba wɔn so. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ a wɔkɔ so yɛ bɔne no nyinaa bɛhunu amane na wɔn werɛ nso bɛho. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Nanso, wɔn a wɔtie no no, sɛ wɔyɛ Yudafoɔ anaa amanamanmufoɔ no, wɔbɛnya animuonyam, anidie ne asomdwoeɛ afiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Onyankopɔn nyɛ nyiyimu na ɔnyɛ animhwɛ nso wɔ nʼatemmuo mu.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Wɔn a wɔnnim mmara no na wɔyɛ bɔne no, wɔbɛkwati mmara no abu wɔn atɛn ara, na wɔn a wɔnim mmara no na wɔyɛ bɔne no, wɔnam mmara no so bɛbu wɔn atɛn. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Ɛnyɛ mmaratiefoɔ na wɔtene wɔ Onyankopɔn anim, na mmom, ɛyɛ wɔn a woyɛ ɔsetie ma mmara no na wɔbɛbu wɔn bem. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Amanamanmufoɔ no nni mmara, nanso wɔfiri wɔn awosu mu yɛ deɛ mmara no hwehwɛ sɛ wɔyɛ a, ɛwom sɛ wɔnni mmara deɛ, nanso yeinom bɛyɛ mmara ama wɔn. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Esiane sɛ wɔn abrabɔ kyerɛ sɛ, deɛ mmara no hwehwɛ no, wɔatwerɛ wɔ wɔn akoma mu no enti, wɔn ahonim di adanseɛ sɛ wɔdi bem anaasɛ wɔabu wɔn fɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Enti, asɛmpa a meka no kyerɛ sɛ, sɛ ɛda no duru a, saa na Onyankopɔn nam Yesu Kristo so bɛbu nnipa kɔkoamsɛm atɛn.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Mo Yudafoɔ deɛ, mosusu sɛ mo ne Onyankopɔn te no yie so, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔde ne Mmara a monam so bɛnya nkwagyeɛ no maa mo. Na moka no mo anofafa so nso sɛ, moyɛ ne nnamfonom sononko bi. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Monim deɛ Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ sɛ moyɛ. Moasua afiri Mmara no mu ahunu deɛ ɛyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Mofa mo ho sɛ moyɛ akwankyerɛfoɔ ma anifirafoɔ, na moyɛ hann nso ma wɔn a wɔte esum mu. <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Mogye di sɛ mobɛtumi akyerɛ adwenemherɛfoɔ ne mmɔfra Onyankopɔn akwan, ɛfiri sɛ, nokorɛm, monim ne Mmara a osuahunu ne nokorɛ ahyɛ no ma no. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Mokyerɛkyerɛ afoforɔ, na adɛn enti na montumi nkyerɛkyerɛ mo ho mo ho? Moka kyerɛ afoforɔ sɛ wɔmmmɔ korɔno. Mo nso mobɔ korɔno anaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Mo a moka sɛ adwamammɔ nyɛ. Mo nso mobɔ adwaman anaa? Mo a moka sɛ mokyiri ahoni no, mo nso mobɔ korɔno wɔ asɔrefie mu anaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Mode mmara no hoahoa mo ho, nanso mobu mmara no so de bu Onyankopɔn animtia. <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Ɛnyɛ nwanwa sɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ mo enti, ewiasefoɔ kasa tia Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Sɛ woyɛ Yudani na wodi Onyankopɔn mmara no so a, ɛyɛ adeɛ a ɛsom bo. Na sɛ moanni so a, nsonsonoeɛ biara nni mo ne momonotofoɔ ntam. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Sɛ momonotofoɔ di Onyankopɔn mmara so a, wɔremmu wɔn sɛ Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ anaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Enti momonotoni a ɔdi mmara no so no bɛkasa atia mo, Yudafoɔ a monim Onyankopɔn mmara a wɔatwerɛ no, nanso monni so no.<verse eid="ROM 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Wo a wɔwoo mo sɛ Yudafoɔ anaasɛ twa a wɔatwa mo twetia no nkyerɛ sɛ moyɛ Yudafoɔ kann. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Yudani kann no ne deɛ ɔyɛ no wɔ nʼakoma mu. Saa ara nso na twetiatwa yɛ akoma mu nsakraeɛ a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn Honhom mu ba. Nsakraeɛ yi mmfiri di a obi di mmara bi so. Na deɛ wɔasakra no ayɛyie mmfiri nnipa hɔ, na mmom, ɛfiri Onyankopɔn hɔ.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Ɛnneɛ na Yudaniyɛ ho mfasoɔ ne sɛn, anaasɛ twetiatwa ho wɔ mfasoɔ bi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Aane mfasoɔ wɔ so. Deɛ ɛdi ɛkan no, Onyankopɔn de ne nsɛm ahyɛ wɔn nsa.<verse eid="ROM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Na sɛ ebinom nni gyidie ɛ? Gyidie a wɔnni no kyerɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn nyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ anaa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Ɛnte saa koraa! Sɛ obiara yɛ ɔtorofoɔ a, Onyankopɔn deɛ, ɔyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ, sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Wodi bem wɔ wo kasa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">na wotene wɔ wʼatemmuo mu.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Na obi bɛka sɛ, “sɛ yɛn bɔne a yɛyɛ no da Onyankopɔn tenenee adi kann a, adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn abufuhyeɛ ba yɛn so?” (Merekasa sɛ onipa) <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Dabi! Sɛ Onyankopɔn nyɛ ɔteneneeni a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na watumi abu ewiase atɛn? <verse eid="ROM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Obi bɛgye akyinnyeɛ aka sɛ, “Sɛ me nkontompo ma Onyankopɔn nokorɛ da adi na nʼanimuonyam boro so a, ɛnneɛ adɛn enti na Onyankopɔn bu me fɔ sɛ ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Ebinom nso bɛka sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ momma yɛnyɛ bɔne sɛdeɛ biribi pa bɛfiri mu aba!” Nnipa bi mpo ka sɛ saa asɛm yi na yɛka. Onyankopɔn bɛbu wɔn atɛn.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obiara Ntene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Ɛnneɛ, ɛdeɛn na yɛnka? Yɛn Yudafoɔ yɛ nnipa sene amanamanmufoɔ no anaa? Ɛnte saa! Makyerɛ mu dada sɛ Yudafoɔ ne amanamanmufoɔ nyinaa yɛ pɛ wɔ bɔne tumi ase. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Obiara nyɛ ɔteneneeni;<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>obiara nyɛ ɔbadwemma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">na obiara nni hɔ a ɔhwehwɛ Onyankopɔn akyiri kwan.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Nnipa nyinaa atwe wɔn ho afiri Onyankopɔn ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">wɔn nyinaa ayɛ bɔne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Obiara nni hɔ a ɔyɛ papa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Ɔbaako mpo nni hɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>“Wɔn anom te sɛ damena a abue;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">na wɔn tɛkrɛma ka atorɔsɛm.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">“Wɔn anofafa ka nsɛm a ɛte sɛ ɔwɔ ano borɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>“Nnome a ɛyɛ hu na ɛfiri wɔn anom ba.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>“Wɔnkyɛre opira ne awudie ho;<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>baabiara a wɔbɛkɔ no, wɔsɛe hɔ pasaa,<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>na wɔnnim asomdwoeɛ kwan.”<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>“Na wɔnnsuro Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Yɛnim sɛ biribiara a ɛwɔ Mmara no mu no, wɔtwerɛ maa wɔn a wɔhyɛ Mmara no tumi ase. Mmara no ka yeinom sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a obiara rennya anoyie, na ama Onyankopɔn akyerɛ sɛ ewiase nyinaa di fɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, obiara nni hɔ a sɛ ɔyɛ deɛ Mmara no hyɛ sɛ ɔnyɛ a, Onyankopɔn bɛbu no bem. Deɛ Mmara no yɛ ara ne sɛ, ɛma onipa hunu sɛ wayɛ bɔne.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Wɔada teneneeyɛ a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn, na ɛmfiri mmara no adi. Ɛno na Mmara no ne Adiyifoɔ no di ho adanseɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Saa teneneeyɛ a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn yi nam gyidie a yɛwɔ wɔ Yesu Kristo mu. Ɛwɔ hɔ ma agyidifoɔ nyinaa. Nsonsonoeɛ biara nni mu. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Na nnipa nyinaa ayɛ bɔne ama Onyankopɔn animuonyam abɔ wɔn, <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>nanso ɔnam Kristo adom nkwagyeɛ no so abu wɔn nyinaa bem kwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Onyankopɔn somaa Kristo sɛ ɔmfa ne ho mmɛbɔ afɔdeɛ mma yɛn. Kristo de ne mogya maaeɛ, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, gyidie a yɛbɛnya wɔ ne mu enti wɔbɛgye yɛn. Saa afɔdeɛ yi ma yɛhunu sɛ, mmerɛ a atwa mu no, Onyankopɔn nam boasetɔ ne adom so de bɔne kyɛeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Ɛfiri sɛ na Onyankopɔn rehwɛ ɛkwan na ɔde wɔn abɛka deɛ ɔreyɛ saa ɛberɛ yi no ho. Onyankopɔn yɛɛ yei de kyerɛɛ ne tenenee, ɛfiri sɛ ɔno ankasa nyɛ nyiyimu, na ɔbu atɛntenenee nso, na sɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ gye Yesu di a, ɔbu wɔn sɛ wɔtene wɔ nʼani so.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Ɛnneɛ ɛdeɛn na yɛde bɛhoahoa yɛn ho? Biribiara nni hɔ! Na adɛn nti? Mmara no a yɛdi so no enti na wagye yɛn anaa? Dabi. Gye a ɔgye yɛn no nnyina mmara a yɛdi so, na mmom, ɛgyina gyidie a yɛwɔ wɔ Yesu mu. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Ne tiawatwa ne sɛ, wɔnam gyidie so na wɔbu onipa bem, na ɛnyɛ Mmara a ɔdi so no enti. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Onyankopɔn yɛ Yudafoɔ nko ara Onyankopɔn anaa? Ɔnyɛ amanamanmufoɔ nso Onyankopɔn bi anaa? Ɛyɛ nokorɛ turodoo sɛ ɔyɛ amanamanmufoɔ nso Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Onyankopɔn yɛ baako, na ɔnam gyidie nko ara a Yudafoɔ wɔ so bɛbu wɔn bem. Na saa ara nso na ɔnam gyidie nko ara so bɛbu amanamanmufoɔ bem. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Enti, yei kyerɛ sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛfa saa gyidie no so gyae Mmara no so di anaa? Dabi, na mmom, sɛ yɛwɔ gyidie a, yɛfoa Mmara no adanseɛ so.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔgyina Abraham Gyidie So Bu No Bem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Ɛdeɛn na yɛbɛka afa yɛn tete agya Abraham ho? Osuahunu bɛn na ɔnyaeɛ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Sɛ wɔnam nneɛma a ɔyɛeɛ so buu no bem a, anka ɔwɔ biribi a ɔde bɛhoahoa ne ho. Nanso, ɔrentumi nhoahoa ne ho Onyankopɔn anim. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Atwerɛsɛm no kyerɛ yɛn sɛ, “Abraham gyee Onyankopɔn diiɛ; na ɛno so na ɛnam maa Onyankopɔn gyee no sɛ ɔteneneeni no.”<verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Onipa a ɔyɛ adwuma no fata nʼakatua; ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔbu nʼakatua no sɛ akyɛdeɛ, na mmom, ɛyɛ biribi a wayɛ ho adwuma anya. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Ɛnyɛ nnwuma bi a onipa yɛ na ɛbɛma Onyankopɔn abu no bem. Onyankopɔn gye nnebɔneyɛfoɔ to mu ɛfiri sɛ wɔwɔ gyidie wɔ ne mu. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Dawid ka asɛm korɔ no ara sɛ, nhyira a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn nkyɛn ba onipa a Onyankopɔn agye no ato mu so. Saa nhyira yi mfiri nnipa nnwuma mu. Ɛno enti Dawid kaa sɛ:<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Nhyira ne wɔn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">wɔde wɔn amumuyɛ akyɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">na wɔakata wɔn bɔne so.<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Nhyira nka onipa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">AWURADE mmu ne bɔne nngu ne so da.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Saa anigyeɛ a Dawid ka ho asɛm no wɔ hɔ ma twetiatwafoɔ nko anaa? Dabi. Ɛwɔ hɔ ma wɔn nso a wɔntwaa twetia no; ɛfiri sɛ, yɛakenkan afiri Atwerɛsɛm no mu sɛ, “Abraham gyee Onyankopɔn diiɛ, na ɛsiane ne gyidie enti, Onyankopɔn gyee no sɛ ɔteneneeni.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Ɛberɛ bɛn na saa asɛm yi siiɛ? Ɛsiiɛ ansa na wɔretwa Abraham twetia anaa Abraham twetiatwa no akyi na ɛsiiɛ? Ɛsiiɛ ansa, na ɛnyɛ twetiatwa no akyi na ɛsiiɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Akyire no na wɔtwaa no twetia, na ne twetiatwa no yɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a ɛkyerɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn gyee no sɛ ɔteneneeni ansa na wɔretwa no twetia. Enti Abraham yɛ Honhom mu agya ma wɔn a wɔgye Onyankopɔn di nyinaa na wɔagye wɔn sɛ ateneneefoɔ a nso wɔntwaa wɔn twetia. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Saa ara nso na Abraham yɛ agya ma obiara a wɔatwa no twetia na ɔwɔ gyidie sɛdeɛ na Abraham wɔ gyidie ansa na wɔretwa no twetia no.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Ɛnyɛ mmara no so na wɔnam hyɛɛ Abraham ne nʼasefoɔ bɔ sɛ wɔbɛyɛ ewiase adedifoɔ, mmom ɛnam tenenee a ɛfiri gyidie mu so. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Sɛ wɔn a wɔdi Mmara so yɛ adedifoɔ a, ɛnneɛ na gyidie nka hwee, na bɔhyɛ no nso ho nni mfasoɔ, <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>ɛfiri sɛ mmara de abufuhyeɛ ba. Na sɛ mmara nni hɔ a, mmarato nni hɔ.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Enti bɔhyɛ no firi gyidie mu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ɛbɛfiri adom mu na ɛbɛtena hɔ ama Abraham asefoɔ nyinaa; ɛnyɛ wɔn a wɔwɔ mmara no ase nko ara, na mmom wɔn a wɔwɔ gyidie sɛ Abraham nso. Ɔyɛ yɛn nyinaa agya. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ no: “Mayɛ wo aman bebree agya.” Onyankopɔn kaa saa, ɛfiri sɛ, Abraham gyee Onyankopɔn a ɔma awufoɔ nya nkwa, na ɔyɛ nneɛma foforɔ firi deɛ ɛnni hɔ mu diiɛ.<verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Ɛberɛ a anidasoɔ asa no, Abraham nyaa anidasoɔ gye diiɛ, enti ɔbɛyɛɛ aman bebree so agya, sɛdeɛ na wɔaka akyerɛ no sɛ, “Saa na wʼasefoɔ bɛyɛ” no. <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Abraham gyidie anhinhim ɛberɛ a na ɔreyɛ adi mfeɛ ɔha no mpo. Na ɔnim nso sɛ ɔregye nna awu, na ne yere Sara nso rentumi nwo mma. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Nanso ne gyidie anhinhim, na wannye Onyankopɔn bɔhyɛ no ho akyinnyeɛ. Ɔhyɛɛ ne gyidie mu den de animuonyam maa Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Na ɔgye dii yie sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛtumi ayɛ deɛ wahyɛ ho bɔ no. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Yei enti wɔbuu no sɛ tenenee maa no. <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Wɔtwerɛɛ sɛ, “Wɔbuu no sɛ tenenee maa no” no, wɔantwerɛ amma ɔno nko ara. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Na mmom wɔtwerɛ maa yɛn nso a Onyankopɔn bɛbu yɛn sɛ ateneneefoɔ, yɛn a yɛgye deɛ ɔnyanee Yesu, yɛn Awurade, firii awufoɔ mu die no. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Yɛn bɔne enti, wɔyii no maa owuo, na wɔnyanee no maa yɛn bembuo.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Asomdwoeɛ Ne Anigyeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Afei a ɛnam gyidie so ama Onyankopɔn abu yɛn bem no, yɛnam Awurade Yesu Kristo so anya Onyankopɔn asomdwoeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Ɔnam gyidie so de yɛn aba Onyankopɔn adom a yɛte mu seesei no mu. Yɛn ani gye wɔ anidasoɔ mu sɛ yɛbɛnya Onyankopɔn anim animuonyam. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Afei, yɛn haw mu nso, yɛn ani gye, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛnim sɛ ɔhaw de boasetɔ ba, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>na boasetɔ de osuahunu ba, ɛnna osuahunu de anidasoɔ ba. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Saa anidasoɔ yi renni yɛn hwammɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn nam Honhom Kronkron a ɛyɛ nʼakyɛdeɛ a ɔde ama yɛn no so ahwie ne dɔ agu yɛn akoma mu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu, ɛberɛ a yɛyɛ mmerɛ no, Kristo wu maa amumuyɛfoɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Na ɛbɛyɛ den sɛ obi bɛwu ama deɛ ɔyɛ onipa tenenee mpo, na deɛ ɔyɛ onipa pa no deɛ, ebia obi bɛsi ne bo awu ama no. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn da ne dɔ adi wɔ yei mu sɛ; ɛberɛ a yɛyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no, Kristo wu maa yɛn.<verse eid="ROM 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Esiane sɛ wɔnam ne mogya no so abu yɛn bem no enti, wɔnam ne so bɛgye yɛn afiri Onyankopɔn abufuhyeɛ mu. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Na sɛ ɛberɛ a yɛyɛ atamfoɔ mpo Onyankopɔn de ne Ba no wuo yɛɛ mpatadeɛ maa yɛn a, saa mmerɛ yi a yɛne Onyankopɔn wɔ ayɔnkofa yi deɛ, yɛnim sɛ ɔnam ne Ba no so bɛgye yɛn nkwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Ɛnyɛ yei nko, mmom yɛnam AWURADE Yesu Kristo a ne mu na yɛanya mpata no gye yɛn ani wɔ Onyankopɔn mu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adam Yɛ Owuo Farebae, Kristo Yɛ Nkwa Farebae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Bɔne nam onipa baako so na ɛbaa ewiase, na ne bɔne no de owuo baeɛ. Ɛno enti owuo trɛ baa nnipa nyinaa so, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn nyinaa yɛɛ bɔne.<verse eid="ROM 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Na bɔne wɔ hɔ ansa na wɔde Mmara no reba. Nanso, mmara nni hɔ a, wɔmmu bɔne ho akonta. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Nanso, ɛfiri Adam ɛberɛ so kɔsi Mose ɛberɛ so no, owuo dii nnipa nyinaa so kɔsii wɔn mpo a wɔanyɛ bɔne, sɛdeɛ Adam deɛ ɔyɛɛ asoɔden kyerɛɛ Onyankopɔn no. Ɛkwan bi so no, Adam yɛ Kristo, deɛ na ɔrebɛba no, sɛso.<verse eid="ROM 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Nanso, wɔn baanu no nyinaa nyɛ pɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn akyɛdeɛ a ɔde kyɛ kwa no nte sɛ Adam bɔne no. Ɛyɛ nokorɛ sɛ ɛsiane saa onipa baako no bɔne enti nnipa pii wuwuiɛ. Nanso, Onyankopɔn adom no dɔɔso; ɛno enti na ɔnam onipa baako a ɔne Yesu Kristo adom so dom bebree kwa no. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Bio, Onyankopɔn akyɛdeɛ no nte sɛ nsunsuansoɔ a ɛfiri onipa baako bɔne mu baeɛ no. Atemmuo no nam bɔne baako so de afɔbuo baeɛ, nanso bɔne bebree akyi no, akyɛdeɛ no de bembuo baeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Sɛ ɛnam onipa baako bɔne so ɛna owuo dii ɔhene a, ɛnneɛ wɔn a wɔnya adom mmorosoɔ ne tenenee akyɛdeɛ no nam onipa baako a ɔne Yesu Kristo so bɛdi hene wɔ nkwa mu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Enti sɛdeɛ onipa baako pɛ bɔne a ɔyɛeɛ no ma wɔbuu nnipa nyinaa fɔ no, saa ara nso na tenenee adeyɛ baako maa wɔbuu nnipa nyinaa bem, na yɛnyaa nkwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Na sɛdeɛ ɛnam ɔbaakofoɔ asoɔden so enti nnipa nyinaa yɛɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no, saa ara nso na onipa baako setie enti, wɔbɛyɛ bebree teneneefoɔ.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Wɔyɛɛ mmara no, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a bɔne bɛda adi pefee; nanso mpɛn dodoɔ a bɔne dɔɔso no, adom no dɔɔso mmoroso, <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>enti sɛdeɛ bɔne di nnipa so de wɔn kɔ owuo mu no, saa ara na adom no nam tenenee so de daa nkwa a ɛwɔ Yesu Kristo, yɛn AWURADE mu bɛba.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkwa Wɔ Kristo Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Afei, asɛm bɛn na yɛbɛka? Yɛbɛkɔ so atena bɔne mu, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a adom bɛdɔɔso anaa? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Ɛnte saa koraa! Yɛawu ama bɔne, na adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ so tena bɔne mu? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Anaa monnim sɛ ɛberɛ a wɔbɔɔ yɛn asu hyɛɛ Kristo Yesu mu no, wɔbɔɔ yɛn asu hyɛɛ ne wuo mu? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔbɔɔ yɛn asu no, yɛwuiɛ, na wɔsiee yɛn ne Kristo. Sɛdeɛ Agya Onyankopɔn nam nʼanimuonyam so nyanee Kristo firii awufoɔ mu baa nkwa mu no, saa ara nso na seesei yɛte ase wɔ nkwa foforɔ mu.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Na sɛ yɛne no ayɛ baako wɔ ne wuo mu a, wɔbɛfa saa ɛkwan korɔ no ara so anyane yɛn aba nkwa mu, na yɛne no ayɛ baako. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Yɛnim sɛ wɔbɔɔ yɛn nipadua dada no ne Kristo asɛnnua mu. Wɔyɛɛ yei sɛdeɛ nipadua dada a ɛyɛ bɔne no renyɛ bɔne nkoa bio, <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>ɛfiri sɛ, sɛ onipa wu a, na wɔayi no afiri bɔne tumi ase.<verse eid="ROM 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Sɛ yɛne Kristo awu a, yɛwɔ gyidie sɛ yɛne no bɛtena. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, yɛnim sɛ wɔanyane Kristo afiri owuo mu na ɔrenwu bio. Owuo nni ne so tumi bio. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Owuo a ɔwuiɛ no, ɔwuu prɛko maa bɔne, na ase a ɔte yi, ɔte ase ma Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="ROM 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Ɛno enti, saa ɛkwan korɔ ara so no, ɛsɛ sɛ mofa mo ho sɛ moawu ama bɔne, na mote ase ma Onyankopɔn wɔ Kristo Yesu mu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ bɔne di mo nipadua a ɛwuiɛ no so na amma mo anyɛ bɔne. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Saa ara nso, ɛnsɛ sɛ mogyaa mo honam akwaa biara ma bɔne sɛ nneɛma a wɔde di amumuyɛsɛm. Na mmom, momfa mo ho mma Onyankopɔn sɛ nnipa a wɔanyane mo afiri owuo mu aba nkwa mu. Momfa mo ho nyinaa mma no, na ɔmfa mo nyɛ tenenee nnwuma. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ bɔne di mo so, ɛfiri sɛ monnhyɛ mmara ase, na mmom, mohyɛ adom ase.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tenenee Nkoa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Ɛdeɛn bio? Esiane sɛ yɛnhyɛ mmara ase na yɛhyɛ adom ase no enti, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ so yɛ bɔne anaa? Dabi! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Monnim sɛ, deɛ motie no ara na ne nkoa ne mo anaa? Sɛ ɛyɛ bɔne a ɛde kɔ owuo mu, anaasɛ ɔsetie a ɛde kɔ tenenee mu. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Nanso, yɛda Onyankopɔn ase! Ɛfiri sɛ, berɛ bi a atwam no a na moyɛ bɔne nkoa no, mode mo akoma nyinaa tiee nkyerɛkyerɛ a wɔde maa mo no. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Wɔagye mo afiri bɔne mu ma moabɛyɛ nkoa ama tenenee.<verse eid="ROM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Esiane mo nipasu enti, mede nkoasom ho mfonitwa reboa mo ama moate yeinom nyinaa ase. Sɛdeɛ mmerɛ bi mode mo ho nyinaa maeɛ sɛ afideɛ ne amumuyɛsɛm nkoa no, afei deɛ momfa nyɛ nkoa mma tenenee nkɔ kronkronyɛ mu. <verse eid="ROM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Ɛberɛ a na moyɛ bɔne nkoa no, na teneneeyɛ nni mo so tumi. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Moyɛɛ nneɛma a afei deɛ mo ani wu wɔ ho no, mfasoɔ bɛn na monyaeɛ? Deɛ ɛkɔwieɛ ne owuo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Nanso, seesei wɔagye mo afiri owuo mu ama moabɛyɛ Onyankopɔn nkoa. Mfasoɔ a monya wɔ mu no kɔ kronkronyɛ mu, na deɛ ɛfiri mu ba yɛ nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Na bɔne so akatua yɛ owuo, nanso Onyankopɔn akyɛdeɛ yɛ nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ, wɔ Kristo Yesu yɛn AWURADE mu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Awadeɛ Yɛ Mfatoho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Nokorɛm, me nuanom, ɛsiane sɛ mo nyinaa nim Mmara no enti, mote deɛ mepɛ sɛ meka no ase; mmerɛ dodoɔ a onipa te ase no, mmara di ne so. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Ɔbaa warefoɔ sei, sɛ ɔte ase nko ara deɛ a, ɔhyɛ ne kunu mmara ase, na sɛ okunu no wu deɛ a, na ɔnhyɛ ne kunu mmara ase bio. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Ɛno enti, sɛ ɔkɔ ɔbarima foforɔ ho ɛberɛ a ne kunu te ase a, wɔfrɛ no ɔwaresɛefoɔ; na sɛ ne kunu no wu a, na ɔnhyɛ saa mmara no ase bio, ɛno enti sɛ ɔware ɔbarima foforɔ a, ɔnyɛ ɔwaresɛefoɔ.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Afei me nuanom, mo nso, Yesu wu a ɔwuiɛ enti moawu afiri mmara no tumi aseɛ. Ne saa enti, mone ɔno a wɔnyanee no firii awufoɔ mu abom sɛdeɛ mobɛtumi asom Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Ɛberɛ a na yɛte ase ma yɛn ho no, yɛn bɔnesu nam mmara no so kanyanee yɛn wɔ yɛn mu maa yɛyɛɛ adwuma maa owuo. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Afei deɛ, yɛnhyɛ mmara biara ase ɛfiri sɛ, yɛwu firii deɛ ɛkyekyeree yɛn sɛ nneduafoɔ no ase. Afei deɛ, yɛnhyɛ mmara biara a wɔatwerɛ no dada ase bio, na mmom, yɛnam honhom foforɔ kwan so na ɛsom.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛne Bɔne Di Apereapereɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Enti, asɛm bɛn na yɛnka? Mmara no yɛ bɔne anaa? Dabi! Mmom, ɛnam mmara so na mehunuu sɛdeɛ bɔne teɛ. Sɛ ɛnyɛ mmara no na ɛkaa sɛ, “Mma wʼani mmere obi adeɛ” a, anka mennim anibereɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Bɔne nyaa kwan nam mmaransɛm no so kekaa ne ho wɔ me mu, maa mʼani beree nneɛma ahodoɔ bebree. Sɛ mmara no nni hɔ a, bɔne nso nni tumi. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Ansa na mɛhunu mmara no na mewɔ nkwa. Nanso mmaransɛm no baeɛ no, metee bɔne ase, na mewuiɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Mehunuu sɛ, mmaransɛm a anka ɛde nkwa bɛba no de owuo baeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Bɔne nam mmaransɛm no so nyaa ɛkwan daadaa me; ɛnam mmaransɛm no so ma bɔne kumm me. <verse eid="ROM 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Nanso mmara no yɛ kronkron; na mmaransɛm no nso yɛ kronkron. Ɛtene na ɛyɛ nso.<verse eid="ROM 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Adeɛ a ɛyɛ no bɛyɛɛ owuo maa me anaa? Dabi! Nanso sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a yɛbɛhunu bɔne sɛ bɔne no, ɛfaa deɛ ɛyɛ so de owuo brɛɛ me. Enti bɔne nam mmaransɛm so maa me hunuu sɛ bɔne yɛ adeɛ a ɛyɛ hu.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Yɛnim sɛ mmara no yɛ honhom mu adeɛ nanso meyɛ ɔhonam muni a wɔatɔn me sɛ akoa ama bɔne. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Mente deɛ meyɛ ase; ɛfiri sɛ, menyɛ deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ meyɛ, na mmom, meyɛ deɛ mekyi. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Sɛ meyɛ deɛ mempɛ sɛ meyɛ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ, mepene so sɛ mmara no yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ no, ɛnyɛ mʼankasa na meyɛ yei; na mmom bɔne a ɛte me mu no. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Menim sɛ ade pa biara nte me mu, me bɔne nipasu yi mu. Ɛfiri sɛ, mepɛ sɛ meyɛ deɛ ɛyɛ, nanso mentumi nyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Papa mepɛ sɛ meyɛ no, menyɛ; mmom bɔne a mempɛ sɛ meyɛ no na meyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Sɛ meyɛ deɛ mempɛ sɛ meyɛ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ ɛnyɛ me na meyɛeɛ, na mmom ɛyɛ bɔne a ɛte me mu no.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Mmara no ama mahunu sɛ biribi te me mu a ɛmma mennyɛ deɛ menim sɛ ɛyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Mʼakoma nyinaa mu, megye Onyankopɔn mmara to mu. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Nanso, mefiri mʼakwaa nyinaa mu hunu sɛ biribi ne mʼadwene di apereapereɛ. Ɛma me yɛ bɔne akoa, na ɛno na ɛhyɛ me ma me yɛ biribiara. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Menni ahotɔ! Hwan na ɔbɛgye me afiri saa ɔhonam a ɛde me rekɔ owuo mu yi? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Menam yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo so meda Onyankopɔn ase.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Na afei, mʼankasa mʼadwene mu, meyɛ akoa ma Onyankopɔn mmara, nanso bɔne nipasu mu no, meyɛ akoa ma bɔne.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkwa A Ɛfiri Honhom Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Enti, afɔbuo nni hɔ ma wɔn a wɔwɔ Kristo Yesu mu <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>ɛfiri sɛ Honhom Kronkron no ama mo nkwa a ɛfiri Kristo Yesu nkyɛn, na agye mo afiri mmara a ɛde owuo ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Esiane ɔhonam mmerɛyɛ enti, Mose Mmara no antumi annye yɛn. Enti Onyankopɔn yɛɛ deɛ Mmara no antumi anyɛ. Ɔnam nʼankasa ne Ba a ɔsomaa no wɔ onipa bɔnesu so no ba bɛbɔɔ afɔdeɛ maa yɛn, na ɔbɛbuu bɔne atɛn de pepaa yɛn bɔne. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Onyankopɔn yɛɛ yei, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Kristo bɛyɛ Mmara no asɛdeɛ ama yɛn, yɛn a yɛnnante ɔhonam fam, na mmom yɛnante honhom mu no.<verse eid="ROM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Wɔn a honam mmerɛyɛ hyɛ wɔn so no dwene bɔne nko ara ho. Wɔn a wɔnam Honhom mu no dwene Honhom deɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Wɔn a wɔwɔ ɔhonam mmerɛyɛ adwene no bɛwu. Wɔn nso a wɔnam Honhom mu no bɛnya nkwa ne asomdwoeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Adwene a ɛdwene honam mu no tan Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛmmrɛ ne ho ase mma Onyankopɔn mmara; na mpo ɛrentumi. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Wɔn a wɔdwene honam mu no rentumi nsɔ Onyankopɔn ani.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Sɛ Onyankopɔn Honhom te mo mu a, ɛnyɛ honam mmerɛyɛ na ɛdi mo so. Na sɛ obi nni Kristo Honhom a, ɔnyɛ Kristo dea. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Ɛwom sɛ bɔne bɛma mo nipadua yi awu deɛ, nanso sɛ Kristo te mo mu a, ne tenenee enti, mo honhom te ase. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Sɛ Onyankopɔn Honhom a ɛnyanee Yesu firii awufoɔ mu no te mo mu a, ɛnneɛ deɛ ɔnyanee Kristo firii awufoɔ mu no nso nam ne Honhom a ɛwɔ mo mu no so bɛma mo nipadua a ɛwu yi nso nkwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Enti anuanom, yɛwɔ asodie bi, nanso, yɛnyɛ mma honam no sɛdeɛ ɔpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Sɛ motena ase ma ɔhonam a, mobɛwu. Nanso, sɛ moma Honhom no kum bɔne a nipadua no yɛ a, mobɛnya nkwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Wɔn a Onyankopɔn Honhom di wɔn so no yɛ Onyankopɔn mma. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, moannya honhom a ɛma mo yɛ nkoa bio ma ɔsuro, na mmom, moanya abayɛ Honhom na yɛnam ne so su sɛ, “Abba, Agya!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Na Honhom no ankasa ne yɛn honhom di adanseɛ sɛ yɛyɛ Onyankopɔn mma. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Esiane sɛ yɛyɛ Onyankopɔn mma enti, yɛyɛ adedifoɔ; Onyankopɔn adedifoɔ a yɛne Kristo wɔ kyɛfa wɔ mu, nanso gye sɛ yɛne no kyɛ nʼamanehunu ansa na yɛne no akyɛ nʼanimuonyam.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daakye Animuonyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Menim sɛ amanehunu a yɛrehunu no saa ɛberɛ yi nyɛ deɛ wɔdetoto animuonyam a wɔbɛhyɛ yɛn no ho. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Abɔdeɛ nyinaa de anigyina rehwɛ da a Onyankopɔn mma bɛda wɔn ho adi no ɛkwan. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ a ɛmfiri abɔdeɛ pɛ mu no, wɔnam Onyankopɔn tumi mu buu abɔdeɛ fɔ sɛ ɛnnane ade hunu. Nanso na saa anidasoɔ yi wɔ hɔ <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>sɛ, da bi abɔdeɛ no bɛde ne ho afiri nkoayɛ ne porɔeɛ mu na ɛne Onyankopɔn mma anya ahofadie mu animuonyam.<verse eid="ROM 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Yɛnim sɛ ɛbɛsi saa ɛberɛ yi abɔdeɛ nyinaa pene sɛ ɔpemfoɔ a awoɔ aka no. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Nanso, ɛnyɛ abɔdeɛ nko, na yɛn a yɛwɔ Onyankopɔn Honhom sɛ Onyankopɔn akyɛdeɛ no nso si apinie ɛberɛ a yɛretwɛn sɛ Onyankopɔn de yɛn bɛyɛ ne mma. Yei kyerɛ sɛ yɛbɛde yɛn ho ɔhonam fam nso. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Na wɔnam saa anidasoɔ yi so gyee yɛn nkwa. Sɛ yɛhunu deɛ yɛn ani da so no deɛ a, na ɛnyɛ anidasoɔ bio. Na hwan na nʼani tumi da adeɛ a ɔwɔ dada so. <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Na sɛ yɛn ani da adeɛ a yɛn nsa nkaeɛ so a, yɛde boasetɔ twɛn.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Saa ara na Honhom no boa yɛn wɔ yɛn mmerɛyɛ mu, ɛfiri sɛ, yɛnnim ɛkwan a wɔfa so bɔ mpaeɛ sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ. Honhom no ankasa de apinisie de nsɛm a ɛnni kabea di ma yɛn. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Onyankopɔn a ɔhunu nnipa akoma mu no nim Honhom no nsusuiɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, Honhom no nam Onyankopɔn pɛ so di ma Onyankopɔn mma wɔ nʼanim.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsene Nkonimdifoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Yɛnim sɛ adeɛ nyinaa mu no Onyankopɔn di boa wɔn a wɔdɔ no ma ɛwie wɔn yie. Ɛdi boa wɔn a wɔnam nʼatirimpɔ so afrɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Wɔn a Onyankopɔn ayi wɔn dada no, ɔde wɔn asi hɔ sɛ wɔnyɛ sɛ ne Ba no, na ne Ba no ayɛ anuanom pii mu abakan. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Onyankopɔn frɛɛ wɔn a ɔyii wɔn sii hɔ no, na wɔn a ɔyii wɔn no, ɔbuu wɔn bem. Na wɔn a ɔbuu wɔn bem no, ɔhyɛɛ wɔn animuonyam nso.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Wɔ Yɛn Afa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Afei, ɛdeɛn na yɛbɛka afa yeinom ho? Onyankopɔn wɔ yɛn afa a, hwan na ɔne yɛn bɛdi asie? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Deɛ wankame nʼankasa ne Ba, na mmom, yɛn nyinaa enti, ɔyii no maeɛ no, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ɔmfa adeɛ nyinaa nso nka ne ho mmɛdom yɛn? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Hwan na ɔbɛbu wɔn a Onyankopɔn ayi wɔn no atɛn? Onyankopɔn nko na ɔbu bem. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Hwan na ɔbu fɔ? Kristo Yesu ne deɛ ɔwuiɛ na wɔnyanee no na ɔte Onyankopɔn nifa so di ma yɛn Onyankopɔn anim no. <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Hwan na ɔbɛtumi atete ɔdɔ a ɛda yɛne Kristo ntam no mu? Ahohia anaa ahometeɛ anaa ɔtaa anaa ɛkɔm anaa adagya anaa amanenya anaa owuo na ɛbɛtumi atete ɔdɔ a ɛda yɛne Kristo ntam no mu no anaa? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Dabi! Wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Wo enti, wɔkum yɛn daa nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">wɔbu yɛn sɛ nnwan a wɔrekɔkum wɔn.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Nanso, yeinom nyinaa mu no, yɛnam deɛ ɔdɔɔ yɛn no so di nkonim boro so. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Megye medi ampa sɛ owuo anaa nkwa anaa abɔfoɔ anaa atumfoɔ anaa nneɛma a ɛwɔ hɔ anaa nneɛma a ɛrebɛba anaa tumi <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>anaa ɔsoro anaa ɛfam anaa abɔdeɛ foforɔ biara rentumi ntete yɛne Onyankopɔn dɔ a ɛwɔ Kristo Yesu, yɛn Awurade, mu no mu da.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Ne Ne Manfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Mereka nokorɛ sɛ Kristoni, na mʼahonim a Honhom Kronkron di no adanseɛ kyerɛ me sɛ menni atorɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Medi awerɛhoɔ na mete daa yea wɔ me akoma mu ma me nkurɔfoɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Wɔn enti anka mepɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn nnome ba me so na ɔte me firi Kristo ho. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Wɔyɛ Onyankopɔn manfoɔ a wɔayi wɔn de wɔn ayɛ ne mma de wɔn asane atena nʼanimuonyam mu. Ɔne wɔn yɛɛ apam no na ɔde mmara no maa wɔn; ɔkyerɛɛ ɛkwan pa a wɔfa so som ma wɔn nsa kaa bɔhyɛ no. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Wɔyɛ tete agyanom asefoɔ, na ɛsiane sɛ Kristo baa onipasu mu enti, ɔyɛ wɔn aseni. Ayɛyie nka Onyankopɔn a ɔyɛ adeɛ nyinaa so otumfoɔ no daadaa. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Mennka sɛ Onyankopɔn bɔhyɛ no amma mu, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛnyɛ Israelfoɔ nyinaa na Onyankopɔn ayi wɔn sɛ ne manfoɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Saa ara nso na ɛnyɛ Abraham asefoɔ nyinaa na wɔyɛ Onyankopɔn mma. Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ Abraham sɛ, “Ɛnam Isak so na wʼase bɛtrɛ.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Yei kyerɛ sɛ ɛnyɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ Abraham mma, na mmom, wɔn a wɔnam Onyankopɔn bɔhyɛ so woo wɔn no na wɔyɛ Abraham asefoɔ turodoo. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Onyankopɔn nam saa bɔhyɛ nsɛm a ɛka sɛ, “Ampa ara, mɛsane aba wo nkyɛn bio ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu no, na wo yere Sara awo ɔba” no so na ɛhyɛɛ saa bɔ no.<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Ɛnyɛ yei nko. Rebeka mma baanu no nyinaa firi agya korɔ a ɔne yɛn agya Isak. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Na sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Onyankopɔn nam ɔba baako so bɛma ne pɛ ada adi no enti, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>ɔka kyerɛɛ Rebeka sɛ, “Ɔpanin no bɛsom akumaa no.” Ɔkaa yei ansa na ɔrewo wɔn ama wɔayɛ papa anaa bɔne. Enti, na Onyankopɔn pɛ no gyina ne frɛ a ɔfrɛɛ wɔn no so, na ɛnyɛ wɔn nneyɛeɛ so, <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, “Medɔɔ Yakob na metanee Esau” no.<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Afei, asɛm bɛn na yɛbɛka? Sɛ Onyankopɔn nyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ anaa? Dabi! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, ɔka kyerɛɛ Mose sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">“Deɛ mepɛ sɛ mehunu no mmɔbɔ no, mɛhunu no mmɔbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">na deɛ mepɛ sɛ meyɛ no adɔeɛ nso, mɛyɛ no adɔeɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Yei kyerɛ sɛ, ɛnnyina deɛ obi pɛ so anaa ne nnwuma so, na mmom ɛgyina Onyankopɔn ahummɔborɔ so. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Atwerɛsɛm no mu, Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ Farao sɛ, “Yei ara enti na mesii wo ɔhene nam so daa me tumi adi, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, me tumi bɛda adi wɔ ewiase afanan nyinaa.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Ɛnneɛ Onyankopɔn hunu deɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔhunu no mmɔbɔ biara no mmɔbɔ, na deɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔma no yɛ asoɔden nso ɔma no yɛ saa.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Afei, obi bɛbisa sɛ, “Sɛ yɛntumi nsi Onyankopɔn pɛ ho ɛkwan a, adɛn enti na ɔbɔ yɛn soboɔ?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Onua, wone hwan a wobɛtumi akasa akyerɛ Onyankopɔn? Kukuo mmisa ne nwomfoɔ sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wonwonoo me sei?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Ɔnwomfoɔ no wɔ ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔde dɔteɛ no nwono deɛ ɔpɛ biara. Ɔtumi nwono nkukuo mmienu firi dɔteɛ mu, na ɔde mu baako adi dwuma titire bi, na ɔde baako no nso ayɛ deɛ ɔpɛ biara.<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Saa ara na adeɛ biara a Onyankopɔn ayɛ no teɛ. Ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔda nʼabufuo adi na ɔma wɔhunu ne tumi. Nanso ɔtɔɔ ne bo ase maa wɔn a anka ɔfiri nʼabufuhyeɛ mu rebɛsɛe wɔn. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Ɔyɛɛ yei de kyerɛɛ sɛdeɛ nʼanimuonyam no teɛ, ɛberɛ a ɔnyaa ayamhyehyeɛ maa wɔn a wayi wɔn dada sɛ wɔmmɛyɛ nʼanimuonyam no fafafoɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Ɛnyɛ wɔn a wɔfrɛɛ wɔn firii Yudafoɔ mu nkoa, na mmom, amanamanmufoɔ nso. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Wɔka wɔ Hosea nwoma mu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Mɛfrɛ wɔn a wɔnyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ no ‘me nkurɔfoɔ’,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">na deɛ ɔnyɛ me dɔfoɔ no mɛfrɛ no ‘me dɔfoɔ,’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>na</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“Beaeɛ korɔ no ara a wɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Monnyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ’ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">ɛhɔ ara na wɔbɛfrɛ wɔn sɛ ‘Onyankopɔn teasefoɔ no mma.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Na Yesaia dii Israelfoɔ ho yea sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Sɛ Israelfoɔ dɔɔso sɛ mpoano anwea mpo a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">wɔn mu kakra bi na wɔbɛgye wɔn nkwa.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Ɛfiri sɛ Awurade bɛyɛ ntɛm, na sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">ɔbɛyɛ deɛ wabɔ ho kɔkɔ sɛ ɔbɛyɛ wɔ asase so no.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Yesaia nso kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Sɛ Awurade Otumfoɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">annya yɛn asefoɔ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">anka yɛayɛ sɛ Sodom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">na yɛadane ayɛ sɛ Gomora.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Nnye Nni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Afei, asɛm bɛn na yɛbɛka bio? Yɛbɛka sɛ amanamanmufoɔ a wɔanhwehwɛ tenenee akyiri kwan no nam gyidie so yɛɛ ateneneefoɔ; <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Nanso, Israelfoɔ a wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔnam mmara so die so bɛsɔ Onyankopɔn ani no mpo, Onyankopɔn annye wɔn anto mu. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Adɛn enti na ɛbaa saa? Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔnam mmara so die so sɔ Onyankopɔn ani, nanso, mmom anka ɛsɛ sɛ wɔnya gyidie wɔ Onyankopɔn mu. Wɔsuntii “suntiboɔ” no. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Hwɛ, Mede ɛboɔ a ɛma nnipa sunti ato Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ne ɔbotan a ɛma wɔhwe ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">na deɛ ɔde ne ho to no soɔ no anim rengu ase da.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Gyidie Ne Bɔneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Anuanom, deɛ mʼakoma pere hwehwɛ yɛ me mpaeɛ a mebɔ srɛ Onyankopɔn ma Israelfoɔ sɛ wɔbɛnya nkwagyeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Mɛtumi madi wɔn ho adanseɛ sɛ wɔyɛ nnipa a wɔde mmɔdemmɔ som Onyankopɔn sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ. Nanso, wɔn som no mfiri nimdeɛ mu. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Wɔammu tenenee a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn no, na mmom wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔfa wɔn ankasa nimdeɛ so. Yei amma wɔamfa wɔn ho anhyɛ Onyankopɔn pɛ a ɔnam so ma onipa wie pɛyɛ no ase. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Kristo ne mmara no awieeɛ, enti obiara a ɔgye die no bɛyɛ ɔteneneeni.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Mose kyerɛɛ sɛ, sɛ onipa di mmara no so a, ɔbɛtumi asɔ Onyankopɔn ani, ɛberɛ a ɔtwerɛeɛ sɛ, “Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔnya nkwa a, ɔnyɛ deɛ mmara no ka no nyinaa.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Nanso wɔn a wɔn gyidie enti Onyankopɔn agye wɔn no, mma wɔmmisa wɔ wɔn akoma mu sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛkɔ ɔsoro akɔfa Kristo aba?” <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Ɛnna wɔremmisa nso sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛkɔ awufoɔ asase so akɔnyane no aba nkwa mu”? <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Deɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka nie, “Onyankopɔn asɛm no abɛn wo, ɛda wʼano na ɛwɔ wʼakoma mu.” Yei ne asɛm a ɛfa gyidie ho a yɛka no. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Sɛ wopae mu ka sɛ, “Yesu ne Awurade”, na wogye di sɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔnyanee no firii awufoɔ mu a, wɔbɛgye wo nkwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Na yɛfiri akoma mu gye di na wɔabu yɛn bem, na yɛde yɛn ano pae mu ka na yɛanya nkwagyeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Na Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, “Obiara a ɔde ne ho to no soɔ no, nʼanim rengu ase.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Nsonsonoeɛ biara nni Yudani ne Aman amanmuni ntam. Awurade baako no yɛ Awurade ma wɔn nyinaa na, ɔhyira wɔn a wɔsufrɛ no. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, “Obiara a ɔbɛbɔ Awurade din no bɛnya nkwa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na nnipa bɛnya gyidie wɔ Awurade mu na wɔabisa no nkwagyeɛ? Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na wɔate, gye sɛ obi ka kyerɛ wɔn. <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Na sɛ wɔansoma wɔn nso a, wɔbɛyɛ dɛn na wɔaka Asɛmpa no? Sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ, “Wɔn a wɔde Asɛmpa no reba no nan yɛ fɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Nanso ɛnyɛ wɔn nyinaa na wɔagye Asɛmpa no adi, sɛdeɛ Yesaia kaa sɛ, “Awurade, hwan na wagye yɛn asɛnka adi?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Ɛnneɛ na gyidie no firi asɛm no tie mu, deɛ yɛte firi Asɛmpa a ɛfa Kristo ho no mu. <verse eid="ROM 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Nanso, mebisa sɛ, Wɔante anaa? Wɔteeɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Wɔn nne akɔduru asase so mmaa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">na wɔn nsɛm nso akɔduru asase ano.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Mebisa bio sɛ, Israelfoɔ te aseɛ anaa wɔante aseɛ? Deɛ ɛdi ɛkan, Mose ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Mɛma moatwe aman a wɔnyɛ me ɔman mpo ho ninkunu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">Mede ɔman a wɔnni nteaseɛ bɛhyɛ mo abufuo.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Na Yesaia de akokoɔduru ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Wɔn a wɔnhwehwɛ me no hunuu me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">medaa me ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔmmisaa mʼase no.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Na deɛ ɔka faa Israelfoɔ ho ne sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Ɛda mu nyinaa matrɛ me nsa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">ama nnipa a wɔyɛ asoɔden ne nyiyiano.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Nkaeɛfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Afei, mebisa sɛ Onyankopɔn ato ne ɔman atwene anaa? Dabi. Mʼankasa meyɛ Israelni na meyɛ Abraham aseni a mefiri Benyamin abusua mu. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Onyankopɔn ampo ne nkurɔfoɔ a ɔyii wɔn ahyɛaseɛ no. Monim deɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka fa Elia sɛdeɛ ɔkasa tiaa Israelfoɔ wɔ Onyankopɔn anim sɛ, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Awurade, wɔakum wʼadiyifoɔ na wɔadwiri wʼafɔrebukyia, na me nko na maka a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔkum me.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Mmuaeɛ bɛn na Onyankopɔn de maa no? Onyankopɔn kaa sɛ, “Mewɔ nnipa mpemnson a wɔnsom ɔbosom Baal.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Saa ara nso na ɛte ɛnnɛ. Nnipa kakra bi wɔ hɔ a Onyankopɔn nam ne dom so ayi wɔn. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Yi a wayi wɔn no gyina nʼadom so na ɛnyɛ wɔn nnwuma so. Na sɛ Onyankopɔn yi a ɔyi nnipa no gyina wɔn nnwuma so a, ɛnneɛ na adom no nyɛ adom turodoo.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Ɛnneɛ na ɛne ɛdeɛn? Deɛ Israelfoɔ tii akyire hwehwɛeɛ no, wɔn nsa anka, na mmom, kakraa a Onyankopɔn ayi wɔn no deɛ, wɔn nsa kaeɛ. Wɔn a wɔaka no pirim wɔn akoma <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Onyankopɔn maa wɔn honhom a ɛyɛ tebɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">ani a ɛmma wɔnhunu adeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">aso a ɛmma wɔnnte asɛm,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">de bɛsi ɛnnɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Na Dawid ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Ma wɔn didipono a ɛsi wɔn anim nyi wɔn sɛ afidie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">na wɔnhwehwe ase na wɔntwe wɔn aso!<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Ma wɔn ani so nyɛ wɔn kusuu na wɔanhunu adeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">na wɔn akyi nkuntunu afebɔɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Afei, mebisa sɛ, ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ yɛɛ bɔne no, ɛde wɔn kɔɔ ɔsɛeɛ mu anaa? Dabi! Amanamanmufoɔ nam Yudafoɔ no bɔne a wɔyɛeɛ no so nyaa nkwagyeɛ. Yei maa Yudafoɔ no twee wɔn so ninkunu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Yudafoɔ no bɔne a wɔyɛeɛ no de nnepa brɛɛ ewiase na wɔn honhom mu hia a wɔdiiɛ no nso de ahonya brɛɛ amanamanmufoɔ. Na ɛba sɛ Yudafoɔ no mu bebree bɛka wɔn ho a, nhyira mmorosoɔ bɛn na ɛremma?<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Afei, merekasa akyerɛ mo amanamanmufoɔ: Esiane sɛ meyɛ amanamanmufoɔ somafoɔ enti, mehoahoa me ho wɔ adwuma a wɔde ahyɛ me nsa no ho. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Sɛ ɛbɛtumi a, mɛma wɔn a wɔyɛ me nuanom Yudafoɔ no kɔn adɔ deɛ mo amanamanmufoɔ nsa aka yi bi, na wɔnam so agye wɔn mu bi nkwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Na sɛ wɔn po a wɔpoo wɔn no ama Onyankopɔn ne ewiasefoɔ aka abom a, ɛnneɛ, gye a Onyankopɔn bɛgye wɔn no de ɛdeɛn na ɛbɛba? Ɛde nkwa bɛbrɛ awufoɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Sɛ wɔde burodo sin ma Onyankopɔn a, ɛnneɛ na ne mu nyinaa yɛ ne dea. Saa ara nso na sɛ dua no nhini yɛ kronkron a, ne mman no nyinaa nso yɛ kronkron.<verse eid="ROM 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Wɔapempan ngo dua a wɔahyɛda adua no mman no bi agu, na wɔde ngo dua a wɔanhyɛda annua no mman abɛhyɛ nʼanan mu. Mo amanamanmufoɔ no te sɛ ngo dua a wɔanhyɛ da annua, nanso afei deɛ, mo ne Yudafoɔ no nyinaa anya Onyankopɔn adom a wɔde adom wɔn no bi. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Nanso monhwɛ yie na moanhoahoa mo ho sɛ wɔde mo asi mman a wɔapempan no ananmu. Monkae sɛ moyɛ mman kɛkɛ, na monyɛ nhini. <verse eid="ROM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Na mobɛka sɛ, “Ɛyɛ, wɔbubuu mman no sɛ wɔmfa me nsi wɔn ananmu.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Aane, nanso monkae sɛ wɔpempan saa mman a ɛyɛ Yudafoɔ no, ɛfiri sɛ wɔannye Onyankopɔn anni, na mogye di enti na mowɔ hɔ. Mommma mo ho so, na mmom monsuro deɛ ɛbɛtumi asie. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Na sɛ Onyankopɔn amfa Yudafoɔ a wɔte sɛ ngo dua pa mman no bɔne ankyɛre wɔn a, mosusu sɛ ɔde mo bɔne bɛkyɛ mo?<verse eid="ROM 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Enti monhwɛ Onyankopɔn ayamyɛ ne ne denyɛ. Ɔyɛ den wɔ wɔn a wɔyɛɛ asoɔden no so, nanso ne yam yɛ ma mo wɔ ɛberɛ a mode mo ho ato nʼayamyɛ so. Na sɛ moamfa mo ho anto no so a, saa ara na wɔbɛpempan mo. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Na sɛ Yudafoɔ no gye di bio a, Onyankopɔn bɛsane de wɔn ayɛ dua no mman bio. Ɔbɛtumi ayɛ saa. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Na sɛ Onyankopɔn pɛɛ sɛ ɔde mo a moyɛ wiram ngo dua mman bɛfam dua papa a ɔno ankasa adua ho, deɛ anka ɛmfa kwan mu a, ɛnneɛ ɔbɛpɛ no mmorosoɔ sɛ ɔde Yudafoɔ no bɛfam dua a ɛyɛ wɔn ankasa dea no ho.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Ahummɔborɔ Wɔ Hɔ Ma Obiara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Me nuanom, ahintasɛm bi wɔ hɔ a mepɛ sɛ mote aseɛ, sɛdeɛ monnyɛ ahantan na monhoahoa mo ho. Yudafoɔ no mu bi apirim wɔn akoma, nanso sɛ amanamanmufoɔ no nyinaa dane ba Kristo nkyɛn a, ɛtoɔ bɛtwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Enti Israelfoɔ nyinaa bɛnya nkwagyeɛ. Mokae deɛ adiyifoɔ no kaa wɔ yei ho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Agyenkwa no bɛfiri Sion aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">na ɔbɛyi amumuyɛsɛm nyinaa afiri Yakob asefoɔ mu.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Na mɛdi apam a me ne wɔn ayɛ no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">na mapepa wɔn bɔne.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Yudafoɔ no bebree ayɛ Asɛmpa no atamfoɔ. Na mo, amanamanmufoɔ anya ho mfasoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn de nʼakyɛdeɛ no ama mo. Nanso, Yudafoɔ yɛ ne ɔman a wapa wɔn ara, ɛsiane ɛbɔ a wahyɛ wɔn nananom enti, <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn akyɛdeɛ ne ne frɛ no, wɔnsesa. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Na mo amanamanmufoɔ deɛ, ɛberɛ a atwam no mu, moyɛɛ asoɔden tiaa Onyankopɔn, nanso Yudafoɔ no poo nʼahummɔborɔ no enti Onyankopɔn hunuu mo mmɔbɔ mmom. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Saa ara nso na ɛsiane adom a moanya no enti, seesei, Yudafoɔ no nso ayɛ asoɔden atia Onyankopɔn. Nanso nna bi akyire no wɔn nso bɛnya Onyankopɔn adom no. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Onyankopɔn aka nnipa nyinaa ahyɛ wɔn asoɔden ase sɛdeɛ ɔbɛyɛ adom ama obiara.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awieeɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Ao Onyankopɔn ahonya ne nyansa ne nimdeɛ bunu a emu dɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Hwan na ɔbɛtumi ahunu nʼatemmuo mu pɛɛpɛeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">na wɔahunu deɛ nʼakwan nenam.<verse eid="ROM 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>“Hwan na ɔnim Awurade adwene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">anaasɛ hwan na ɔyɛ ne fotufoɔ?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>“Hwan na wama Onyankopɔn biribi kane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">a ɛsɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn tua no so ka?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, adeɛ nyinaa firi ne mu na ɛba, na ɛnam ne so na ɛba, na ɛbɛsane akɔ ne nkyɛn bio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Ɔno na animuonyam wɔ no daa daa. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Afɔrebɔ A Ɛte Ase Ma Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Ɛno enti, anuanom, ɛsiane Onyankopɔn ahummɔborɔ enti, mehyɛ mo sɛ momfa mo onipadua mmɔ afɔdeɛ a ɛyɛ kronkron na ɛsɔ Onyankopɔn ani. Yei ne nokwasɛm a ɛsɛ sɛ mosɔ mu. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Monnyɛ mo ho sɛ ewiasefoɔ wɔ mo abrabɔ mu, na mmom, momma Onyankopɔn nsakra mo adwene wɔ mo mu, na moanya adwene foforɔ, na ɛnam so ama moahunu Onyankopɔn apɛdeɛ, deɛ ɛyɛ, deɛ ɛsɔ nʼani ne deɛ ɛwie pɛyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Na ɛsiane Onyankopɔn adom a ɔde ama me no enti, meka mekyerɛ mo nyinaa sɛ, monnnwene mo ho mma ɛmmoro sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ sɛ modwene, na mmom, monnwene mo ho ahobrɛaseɛ mu, na mo mu biara nnyina gyidie a Onyankopɔn de ama mo no so. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Sɛdeɛ yɛn mu biara wɔ onipadua a ɛho akwaa yɛ bebree no, na saa akwaa yi mu biara wɔ dwuma a ɛdi no, <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>saa ara na Kristo mu no yɛn a yɛyɛ bebree no yɛ onipadua baako, na akwaa biara yɛ akwaa no nyinaa dea. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Yɛwɔ akyɛdeɛ ahodoɔ sɛdeɛ wɔde adom yɛn no. Sɛ obi akyɛdeɛ yɛ nkɔmhyɛ a, ma ɔnnyina ne gyidie so mfa nyɛ adwuma. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Sɛ ɛyɛ ɔsom a, ma ɔnsom; Sɛ ɛyɛ nkyerɛkyerɛ a, ma ɔnkyerɛkyerɛ; <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ yɛhyɛ afoforɔ nkuran a, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ saa; sɛ ɛyɛ mmoa a ɔde boa afoforɔ a, ma ɔmfiri akoma pa mu nyɛ; sɛ ɛyɛ akwankyerɛ a, ma no mfa nsi nyɛ; sɛ ɛyɛ ayamyɛ a, ma ɔmfa anigyeɛ nyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onuadɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdɔ yɛ nokorɛ turodoo. Monkyiri amumuyɛ. Mommata deɛ ɛyɛ ho. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Momfa onuadɔ nnodɔ mo ho. Monni afoforɔ ni nsen mo ho. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Monkɔ so nyɛ nsi, monyɛ hye wɔ honhom mu, na momfa ahosɛpɛ nsom Awurade. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Monnya anidasoɔ mu anigyeɛ, amanehunu mu boasetɔ, na momfa gyidie mmɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Mone Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ a ahia wɔn no nkyɛ deɛ mo wɔ. Mommɔ ahɔhosom ho mmɔden.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Monhyira wɔn a wɔtaa mo no; Monhyira wɔn na monnnome wɔn. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Mo ne anigyefoɔ ani nnye, na mo ne asufoɔ nsu. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Mo ne afoforɔ ntena asomdwoeɛ mu. Monnyɛ ahantan, na mmom momfa mo ho mmɔ mmɔborɔfoɔ. Mommmu mo ho anyansafoɔ.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Mommfa bɔne ntua bɔne biara so ka. Monyɛ deɛ ɛbɛma nnipa de anidie ama mo. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Sɛ ɛbɛtumi a, mo fam deɛ, mo ne obiara ntena asomdwoeɛ mu. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Monntɔ wereɛ me nnamfonom, na mmom momma Onyankopɔn abufuo ho ɛkwan ɛfiri sɛ, wɔatwerɛ sɛ, “Me na aweretɔ wɔ me, mɛtua ka,” Awurade na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Enti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">“Sɛ ɛkɔm de wo ɔtamfoɔ a, ma no aduane nni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">sɛ osukɔm de no a, ma no nsuo nnom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Na sɛ woyɛ saa a, woboaboa gyasramma ano gu nʼatifi.”<verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Mommma bɔne nni mo so. Mmom, momfa papa nni bɔne so.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Momfa Nidie Mma Tumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ obiara brɛ ne ho ase ma tumi a ɛwɔ ɔman no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, tumi biara nni hɔ a ɛmfiri Onyankopɔn pɛ mu. Tumi biara a ɛwɔ hɔ no firi Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Obiara a ɔne tumi a ɛwɔ hɔ no di asie no tia deɛ Onyankopɔn ahyehyɛ. Na obiara a ɔbɛyɛ saa no de atemmuo ba nʼankasa ara so. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Wɔn a wɔyɛ papa no nsuro atumfoɔ, na mmom wɔn a wɔyɛ amumuyɛ no na wɔsuro atumfoɔ. Wopɛ sɛ woyɛ obi a ɔnsuro deɛ tumi wɔ ne nsam anaa? Ɛnneɛ, yɛ deɛ ɛtene na ɔbɛkamfo wo. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn ɔsomfoɔ a wo yiedie mu enti na ɔyɛ adwuma. Na sɛ woyɛ bɔne a, suro no ɛfiri sɛ, ne tumi a ɔde twe aso no da hɔ fann. Ɔyɛ Onyankopɔn ɔsomfoɔ, enti ɔnam Onyankopɔn abufuo so twe wɔn a wɔyɛ bɔne no aso. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Esiane saa enti, ɛsɛ sɛ wobrɛ wo ho ase ma tumi, a ɛnyɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn abufuo no enti, na mmom, ɛsiane nim a wonim sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ woyɛ no enti.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Yei enti na ɛsɛ sɛ wotua toɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, sɛ atumfoɔ no yɛ wɔn adwuma a, wɔyɛ ma Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Enti, tua ka a wode wɔn; tua ka a wode; sɛ ɛyɛ wo honam mu ka anaasɛ ɛyɛ agyapadeɛ ho ka, na fa obuo ne anidie ma wɔn nyinaa.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛdeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Nne obiara ka. Ɛka a ɛsɛ sɛ wode ara ne sɛ wobɛdɔ afoforɔ. Obiara a ɔdɔ ne yɔnko nnipa no adi mmara no so. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Mmaransɛm a ɛka sɛ, “Nsɛe awadeɛ, nni awu, mmɔ korɔno, mma wʼani mmere adeɛ,” yeinom ne deɛ ɛkeka ho nyinaa tiawatwa ara ne sɛ, “Dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Obiara a ɔdɔ ne yɔnko no nyɛ no bɔne. Sɛ wodɔ wo yɔnko a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ woadi mmara no nyinaa so.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ woyɛ yei, ɛfiri sɛ, wonim mmerɛ a wowɔ mu. Ɛberɛ aduru sɛ wosɔre firi wo nna mu. Ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔgye yɛn nkwa no abɛn sene ɛberɛ a yɛgye dii kane no. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Adesaeɛ retwam, na adekyeeɛ reyɛ abɛn yɛn. Enti, momma yɛnnyae nneɛma a ɛyɛ sum deɛ no yɛ, na momfa akodeɛ a wɔde ko hann mu no. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Momma yɛmmɔ yɛn bra yie te sɛ nnipa a wɔte hann no mu a agobɔne anaa nsãborɔ, adwamammɔ anaa ahohwie, ɔko anaa anibereɛ nni mu. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Momma Awurade Yesu Kristo mmɛn mo te sɛ ntoma a mofira, na morempɛ sɛ mobɛyɛ deɛ ɔhonam pɛ.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Mommmu Atɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Sɛ obi gyidie sua wɔ mo mu a, monnye no; mo ne no nnnye deɛ nʼadwene kyerɛ no no ho akyinnyeɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Obi gyidie ma ɔtumi di biribiara, nanso obi a ne gyidie sua no di afuomduane nko ara. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ deɛ ɔdi biribiara no bu deɛ ɔnni biribiara no animtia; saa ara nso na ɛnsɛ sɛ obi a ɔdi afuomduane nko ara no bu deɛ ɔdi biribiara no atɛn; ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn agye no. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Wo ne hwan a wobu obi ɔsomfoɔ atɛn? Ɛyɛ ɔno ankasa ne wura na ɔbɛka sɛ wadi nkonim anaasɛ wadi nkoguo. Na ɔbɛdi nkonim, ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade bɛtumi ama wadi nkonim.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Obi dwene sɛ da bi wɔ hɔ a ɛho hia sene nna a aka no. Saa ara nso na onipa foforɔ nso dwene sɛ nna nyinaa yɛ pɛ. Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔn mu biara si nʼadwene pi. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Obiara a ɔbɛbu da bi kɛseɛ no yɛ saa de hyɛ Awurade animuonyam; obiara a ɔwe nam no we wɔ Awurade din mu, ɛfiri sɛ ɔda Onyankopɔn ase; saa ara na wɔn a wɔnwe nso yɛ saa wɔ Awurade din mu de da Onyankopɔn ase. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Yɛn mu biara nte ase mma ne nko ara ho na obiara nwu mma ne nko ara ho; <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>sɛ yɛte ase a yɛte ase ma Awurade; na sɛ yɛwu a, yɛwu ma Awurade. Enti, sɛ yɛte ase o, yɛwu o, yɛyɛ Awurade deɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Na yei enti na Kristo wuiɛ, na ɔsɔreeɛ, na ɔnyaa nkwa sɛ ɔbɛyɛ awufoɔ ne ateasefoɔwura.<verse eid="ROM 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Na wo, afei, adɛn enti na wobu wo nua atɛn? Na wo, adɛn enti na wobu wo nua animtia? Yɛn nyinaa bɛgyina Onyankopɔn anim ama wabu yɛn atɛn. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“ ‘Awurade ka sɛ, mete ase yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">obiara bɛbu nkotodwe wɔ mʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">na obiara bɛpae mu aka sɛ, mene Onyankopɔn.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Yɛn mu biara bɛbu ne ho akonta akyerɛ Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Ɛno enti, momma yɛnnyae yɛn ho yɛn ho atemmuo. Mmom, deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ modwene ne sɛ, monnyɛ biribiara a ɛbɛma mo nua akɔ bɔne mu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Ahotɔsoɔ a mewɔ wɔ mʼAwurade Yesu mu no ma mehunu sɛ biribiara nni hɔ a ɛho nte. Na sɛ obi gye di sɛ biribiara ho nte a, na saa onipa no na ɛho nte mma no. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Sɛ biribiara a wodi ha wo nua a, ɛnneɛ na wonte hɔ ɔdɔ mu. Mma aduane a wodi no nsɛe onipa a ne enti Kristo wuiɛ no. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Mma adeɛ a wobu sɛ ɛyɛ no nnye din bɔne. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn Ahennie no nyɛ adidie ne ɔnom na mmom, ɛyɛ tenenee, asomdwoeɛ ne ahosɛpɛ a ɛwɔ Honhom Kronkron mu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Obiara a ɔsom Kristo saa ɛkwan yi so no, Onyankopɔn agye no ato mu, na nnipa bu no.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Ɛno enti, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛtumi tena asomdwoeɛ mu, na yɛboaboa yɛn ho yɛn ho ma obiara nya gyidie a emu yɛ den. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Nnyina aduane so nsɛe deɛ Onyankopɔn ayɛ. Aduane biara yɛ aduane, nanso sɛ wodi aduane a ɛde ɔfoforɔ bɛkɔ bɔne mu a, ɛyɛ bɔne. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Ade tenenee a ɛsɛ sɛ woyɛ ne sɛ, wonwe ɛnam, nnom nsã anaasɛ wonyɛ biribi a ɛbɛto wo nua suntidua.<verse eid="ROM 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Deɛ wogye di wɔ saa asɛm yi ho no, ma ɛnka wo ne Onyankopɔn ntam. Nhyira ne deɛ ɔyɛ nʼapɛdeɛ a ɔnte nka sɛ wɔabu no atɛn. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Na sɛ ne tirim ntene no deɛ ɔdi ho a, sɛ ɔdi a, Onyankopɔn bu no atɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ ɔyɛ no mfiri gyidie mu. Biribiara a ɛmfiri gyidie mu no nso yɛ bɔne.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛn a yɛyɛ den wɔ gyidie mu no tumi te wɔn a wɔyɛ mmerɛ no sintɔ ase. Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛsɔ wɔn ani na yɛansɔ yɛn ara ani. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Yɛn mu biara nkamfo adepa biara ne yɔnko yɛ, mfa nhyɛ no den. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Kristo mpo anyɛ deɛ ɔpɛ, sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm ka sɛ, “Nnipa a wɔbɔ mo ahohora no bɔ me ahohora nso.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Biribiara a wɔatwerɛ wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no mu no, wɔatwerɛ de kyerɛkyerɛ yɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, yɛnam boasetɔ, nkuranhyɛ a Kristo Atwerɛsɛm no de ma yɛn no so bɛnya anidasoɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Onyankopɔn a yɛnya boasetɔ ne nkuranhyɛ firi ne nkyɛn no, mma mo honhom mu nkabom na mode adi Kristo Yesu akyi, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, mo nyinaa de akoma korɔ ne ano korɔ bɛkamfo Onyankopɔn, yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo Agya no.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Momma mo ho nka mo ho mo ho mfa nhyɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam sɛdeɛ Kristo agye mo no. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, meka kyerɛɛ mo sɛ, Kristo Yesu bɛyɛɛ Yudafoɔ ɔsomfoɔ de kyerɛɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn yɛ ɔnokwafoɔ a ɔbɛma ne bɔ a ɔhyɛɛ agyanom no aba mu, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>na wama amanamanmufoɔ nso akamfo no wɔ ne mmɔborɔhunu ho, sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Yei enti, mɛkamfo wo wɔ amanamanmufoɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">na mato nnwom akamfo wo din.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Na ɛka bio sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Mo amanamanmufoɔ, monkamfo Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">mo ne ne nkurɔfoɔ, Yudafoɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Na bio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Amanamanmufoɔ nyinaa nyi Awurade ayɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">asase so aman nyinaa monkamfo no.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Na bio Yesaia ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Yisai aseni bɛsɔre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">deɛ ɔbɛsɔre abɛdi amanaman no so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ɔno na wɔn ani bɛda ne so.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Anidasoɔ Onyankopɔn no a mogye no die no mfa anigyeɛ ne asomdwoeɛ nhyɛ mo ma, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a Honhom Kronkron tumi no bɛma mo anidasoɔ mmorosoɔ.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo, Amanamanmufoɔ Ɔsɔfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Me nuanom, mʼankasa mete nka sɛ, papayɛ ahyɛ mo ma, mowɔ nimdeɛ na mobɛtumi akyerɛkyerɛ mo ho mo ho. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Mede akokoɔduru atwerɛ abobɔ nneɛma bi so, sɛdeɛ meretwe mo adwene akɔ so bio, ɛsiane adom bi a Onyankopɔn de adom me no enti. <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Meyɛ Kristo Yesu ɔsomfoɔ a ɛsɛ sɛ meyɛ asɔfodwuma a mepae mu ka Onyankopɔn Asɛmpa no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, amanamanmufoɔ bɛyɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ a ɛsɔ Onyankopɔn ani a Honhom Kronkron no ate ho.<verse eid="ROM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Ɛno enti, metumi hoahoa me ho wɔ Kristo Yesu mu wɔ Onyankopɔn som yi mu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Deɛ mɛka ho asɛm ara ne sɛdeɛ Kristo nam deɛ maka ne deɛ mayɛ so ama amanamanmufoɔ ayɛ ɔsetie ama Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Saa nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ yi yɛ tumi a ɛfiri Honhom no mu. Enti, ɛfiri Yerusalem kɔka Iliriko, mapae mu aka Kristo Asɛmpa no nyinaa. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Na me botaeɛ ne sɛ, daa mɛka asɛmpa no wɔ mmeammea a wɔntee Kristo ho asɛm da no, na ankɔyɛ sɛ mesii dan wɔ obi fapem so. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Mmom sɛdeɛ wɔatwerɛ no:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Wɔn a wɔnkaa ne ho asɛm nkyerɛɛ wɔn no bɛhunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">na wɔn a wɔnteeɛ no nso bɛte aseɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Yei enti na ɛberɛ biara a mepɛ sɛ meba mo nkyɛn no, biribi si me ɛkwan.<verse eid="ROM 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Yɛ Nʼadwene Sɛ Ɔbɛkɔ Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Nanso, seesei a mawie mʼadwuma wɔ saa amantam yi mu, na afei mfeɛ bebree ni a mepɛɛ sɛ anka mɛba abɛhunu mo no enti, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>mayɛ mʼadwene sɛ mɛkɔ Spania. Sɛ merekɔ a, mɛpɛ sɛ mɛhunu mo na moaboa me ama makɔ hɔ ɛberɛ a me ne mo atena anigyeɛ so kakra bi no. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Seesei ara, merekɔ Yerusalem makɔsom Onyankopɔn manfoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, asafo a ɛwɔ Makedonia ne Akaia no asi wɔn adwene pi sɛ wɔbɛboa ahiafoɔ a wɔfra Onyankopɔn manfoɔ a wɔwɔ Yerusalem no mu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Wɔn ara na wɔsii wɔn adwene pi saa, nanso nokorɛm, ɛyɛ wɔn asɛdeɛ sɛ wɔboa saa ahiafoɔ no. Amanamanmufoɔ no nyaa Yudafoɔ honhom no mu nhyira no bi. Ɛno enti na ɛsɛ sɛ amanamanmufoɔ no de wɔn ahodeɛ som Yudafoɔ no. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Sɛ mewie saa dwumadie yi na mekɔ wɔn nkyɛn na mede sika a wɔapɛ no nyinaa ma wɔn a, mɛfiri hɔ akɔ Spania. Na sɛ merekɔ a, mɛduru mo hɔ mabɛsra mo. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Sɛ meba mo nkyɛn a, menim sɛ mede Kristo nhyira a ɛboro so no bɛba.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Anuanom, menam yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo ne ɔdɔ a Honhom no de ma me no so hyɛ mo sɛ, mo ne me mmɔ mu mmɔ Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ denden mma me. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Mommɔ mpaeɛ, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, asɛm bi rento me wɔ Yudea. Mommɔ mpaeɛ mma wɔn a wɔnnye asɛm no nni. Afei nso, mommɔ mpaeɛ mma me som a mɛsom wɔ Yerusalem no, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ahotefoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no bɛgye atom. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Sɛ ɛyɛ Onyankopɔn pɛ a, mede ahosɛpɛ bɛba mo nkyɛn mabɛsra mo. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Asomdwoeɛ Onyankopɔn no ne mo nyinaa ntena. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Nkyea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Mede yɛn nuabaa Foibe a ɔsom Kenkrea asafo no hyɛ mo nsa. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Monnye no Awurade din mu sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn manfoɔ yɛ, na mmoa biara a ɛho hia no wɔ mo nkyɛn no, momfa mmoa no. Ɛfiri sɛ, waboa nnipa bebree ne me nso.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Mekyea Priska ne Akwila a wɔyɛ me nuanom adwumayɛfoɔ wɔ Kristo Yesu mu <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>a wɔpaa wɔn nkwa akyi maa me no. Meda wɔn ase bebree, ɛnyɛ me nko, na mmom, amanamanmufoɔ asafo no nyinaa.<verse eid="ROM 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Asafo a wɔhyia wɔ wɔn fie no nso, mekyea wɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Monkyea mʼadamfo pa Epaineto a ɔno ne onipa a ɔdii ɛkan gyee Kristo dii wɔ Asia mantam mu no mma me.<verse eid="ROM 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Afei, mekyea Maria a ɔyɛɛ adwuma denden maa me no nso.<verse eid="ROM 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Mekyea Androniko ne Yunia. Mekyea me nuanom Yudafoɔ a me ne wɔn daa afiase a wɔagye din yie wɔ asomafoɔ no mu, na wɔdii me ɛkan Kristo mu no.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Mekyea mʼAwurade mu dɔfo Amplia.<verse eid="ROM 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Mekyea Ubano a yɛne no someeɛ wɔ Kristo mu. Saa ara nso na mekyea mʼadamfo pa Staki.<verse eid="ROM 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Mekyea Apele a ne Kristosom mu nokorɛ ada adi no,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:10">Mekyea Aristobulo abusuafoɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="ROM 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Mekyea me kuromni Yudani Herodion ne ne nuanom Akristofoɔ a wɔfiri Narkiso fie.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Mekyea Trifaina ne Trifosa mmaa a wɔbɔ Awurade som mu mmɔden no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:12">Saa ara nso na mekyea mʼadamfo Persi a ɔno nso yɛ ɔbaa a wabɔ mmɔden aboa Awurade som no.<verse eid="ROM 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Mekyea Rufo a wadi dwuma kɛseɛ Awurade som mu no. Mekyea Rufo maame a ɔfaa me sɛ ne ba no nso.<verse eid="ROM 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Mekyea Asinkrito, Flegon, Herme, Patroba, Herma, ne anuanom Akristofoɔ a wɔka wɔn ho nyinaa.<verse eid="ROM 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Mekyea Filologo ne Yulea, Nereo ne ne nuabaa ne Olimpa ne Onyankopɔn manfoɔ a wɔne no wɔ hɔ no nyinaa.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Momfa mfeano kronkron nkyeakyea mo ho mo ho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:16">Kristo asafo no nyinaa kyea mo.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Anuanom, metu mo fo sɛ, monhwɛ wɔn a wɔde mpaapaemu ne wɔn a wɔsɛe afoforɔ gyidie na wɔtia nkyerɛkyerɛ a moanya no yie; montwe mo ho mfiri wɔn ho. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn a wɔyɛ saa no nsom Kristo, yɛn Awurade no; na mmom, wɔsom biribiara a wɔpɛ na ɛyɛ ma wɔn. Wɔdɛfɛdɛfɛ wɔn a wɔnnim hwee. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Obiara ate gyidie a mowɔ wɔ Asɛmpa no mu. Ɛno enti, ɛma mʼani gye mo ho. Mepɛ sɛ mo ani te wɔ nneɛma pa ho na mokata mo ani wɔ bɔne ho.<verse eid="ROM 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Na Onyankopɔn a ɔbrɛ yɛn asomdwoeɛ no bɛpɛkyɛ Ɔbonsam wɔ mo nan ase.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 16:20"/>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo adom nka mo.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Me yɔnko Timoteo se ɔkyea mo. Saa ara nso na Lukio, Yason ne Sosipatro a wɔyɛ me nuanom Yudafoɔ no nso kyea mo.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Me Tertio, a meyɛ ɔtwerɛfoɔ ma Paulo yi nso, mede Awurade din mekyea mo.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Gaio a asafo no hyia wɔ ne fie no nso kyea mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Erasto a ɔyɛ kurom ha sikakorafoɔ ne yɛn nua Kwarto se wɔkyea mo. <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Yɛn Awurade Yesu Kristo adom nka mo nyinaa.<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Momma yɛnyi Onyankopɔn ayɛ! Ɔno na ɔtumi ma mo gyina pintinn wɔ mo gyidie mu sɛdeɛ mekaa wɔ Asɛmpa a ɛfa Yesu Kristo ho kyerɛɛ mo no. Sɛdeɛ medaa nokorɛ ahintasɛm a ɛfiri teteete no adi kyerɛɛ mo no, <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>wɔnam adiyifoɔ atwerɛsɛm a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn Teasefoɔ no nkyɛn ada ahintasɛm yi adi ama wɔahunu sɛdeɛ aman nyinaa bɛgye adi na wɔayɛ ɔsetie ama no. <verse eid="ROM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Ɔno, Onyankopɔn nyansaboakwa na animuonyam nka no wɔ Yesu Kristo mu daa daa! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
